# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Deny-by-default.
#
# This project was developed in a folder shared with unrelated checkouts,
# so the list below is an allowlist rather than a list of exclusions:
# ignore everything, then re-admit the AHMED files by name. `git add -A`
# then cannot sweep in a neighbouring project, your filled-in config, or
# your API keys, however the folder is laid out.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*

# ── The assistant ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.env.example
!Ecosine.html
!ecosine-server.js

# ── Tools the server shells out to ───────────────────────────────────
!ecosine-assets.py
!ecosine-daily.py
!ecosine-fleet.py
!ecosine-mail.py
!ecosine-xlsx.py
!ecosine-ocr.js
!make-report-templates.py

# ── Config + branding ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Templates only. The filled-in versions stay on the machine that runs this:
# they hold your contact details, your colleagues' names and where your
# vehicles are parked. None of that belongs in a public repository.
!ecosine-profile.example.json
!ecosine-team.example.json
!ecosine-locations.example.json
!ecosine-logo.html

# ── Mail setup (double-clickable from Finder) ────────────────────────
!setup-mail.sh
!Setup Mail.command
!Check Mail Login.command

# ── Never, under any circumstances ───────────────────────────────────
.env
ecosine-profile.json
ecosine-team.json
ecosine-locations.json
*.key
*.pem
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
